---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Experience">
  <section class="py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-12">Experience</h1>
    
    <div class="relative border-l border-zinc-200/80 relative ml-3 md:ml-0 space-y-12">
      
      <div class="pl-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute absolute w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-[4px] ring-[#FAFAFA] z-10 -left-[4.5px] top-2"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Senior Software Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-4">VALT Limited &bull; May 2026 – Present</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-600 space-y-3">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Led, implemented, and integrated Retail module for VALT POS project, delivering a high-impact solution for end-users.</li>
            <li>Migrated VALT POS Order Process from legacy Java to Kotlin, resulting in a highly optimized order processing system.</li>
            <li>Successfully established and managed complex order interconnections between VALT POS, VALT KIOSK, and VALT KDS.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 pt-2">
            <span class="text-zinc-900">Tech Stack:</span> Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Java, Android SDK, Payment SDK, Firebase, SQLite, Room, WebSocket, REST APIs, Bitbucket Pipelines
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pl-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute absolute w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 ring-[4px] ring-[#FAFAFA] z-10 -left-[4.5px] top-2"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Senior Software Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-4">Hurraayy Limited &bull; Jan 2024 – Apr 2026</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-600 space-y-3">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Led development of Hurraayy, a cross-platform home-sharing marketplace app (similar to Airbnb), built for iOS and Android.</li>
            <li>Designed modular, testable UI components, reducing build time by 25% and improving scalability for new features.</li>
            <li>Integrated REST APIs for listings, booking, messaging, payments and maps with Hive caching, reducing API calls by 30% and improving response speed.</li>
            <li>Implemented WebSocket for real-time pricing and availability updates, reducing API polling by 40% and boosting booking accuracy and engagement.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 pt-2">
            <span class="text-zinc-900">Tech Stack:</span> Kotlin, Swift, Flutter, Firebase, Hive, WebSocket, GCP, REST APIs, GitLab CI/CD
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pl-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute absolute w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 ring-[4px] ring-[#FAFAFA] z-10 -left-[4.5px] top-2"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Senior Software Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-4">ProHealth Limited &bull; Apr 2022 – Dec 2023</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-600 space-y-3">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Built and optimized cross-platform Flutter apps (iOS, Android, Desktop), scaling to 10,000+ users, improving performance and reducing crashes by 30%.</li>
            <li>Led CI/CD pipelines, mentored 4 junior developers, and established coding standards to accelerate delivery and boost engagement.</li>
            <li>Integrated WebSocket connections for real-time doctor-patient chat and video calls, cutting message latency to &lt;200ms for seamless consultations.</li>
            <li>Developed secure API endpoints for appointment scheduling and prescription management, ensuring reliable and safe data handling.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 pt-2">
            <span class="text-zinc-900">Projects:</span> ProHealth (Healthcare platform), Health360 (Digital pharmacy)
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">
            <span class="text-zinc-900">Tech Stack:</span> Dart, Flutter, Firebase, SQLite, WebSocket, AWS, REST APIs, WebRTC, GitHub Actions
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pl-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute absolute w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 ring-[4px] ring-[#FAFAFA] z-10 -left-[4.5px] top-2"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Software Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-4">Extreme Solutions &bull; Nov 2020 – Feb 2022</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-600 space-y-3">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Designed and deployed cross-platform Flutter apps (iOS, Android), delivering seamless experiences to 50,000+ users.</li>
            <li>Improved code quality and scalability using design patterns, cutting feature delivery time by 25% and reducing production bugs by 30%.</li>
            <li>Containerized apps with Docker, streamlining deployments and boosting production reliability with 40% fewer deployment issues.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500 pt-2">
            <span class="text-zinc-900">Projects:</span> ExtremePOS, RedID, eStore
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">
            <span class="text-zinc-900">Tech Stack:</span> Dart, Flutter, Firebase, Hive, GCP, REST APIs, Bitrise
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pl-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute absolute w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 ring-[4px] ring-[#FAFAFA] z-10 -left-[4.5px] top-2"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Software Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-4">Cynergy Solutions, LLC &bull; Aug 2018 – Oct 2020</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-600 space-y-3">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Developed .NET Core business apps with predictive time series analysis, driving actionable insights for end users.</li>
            <li>Migrated data to interactive dashboards, doubling response speed and reducing server load by 5&times;.</li>
            <li>Automated CI/CD and data workflows with Docker and Unix scripts, streamlining deployments and boosting reliability.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pl-8 relative">
        <span class="absolute absolute w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-300 ring-[4px] ring-[#FAFAFA] z-10 -left-[4.5px] top-2"></span>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Software Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-4">Automate Infosys &bull; Jan 2018 – Jul 2018</p>
        <div class="text-zinc-600 space-y-3">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>Designed and developed greenfield and brownfield web applications, delivering seamless and reliable user experiences across platforms.</li>
            <li>Ensured high-quality, standards-compliant code through testing, validation, and cross-browser/device compatibility, reducing defects by 30%.</li>
            <li>Collaborated in agile teams, leveraging user and peer feedback to enhance features and improve application performance by 10%.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

